I read about 40 benchmark repositories and 230 sources to understand computer use scores. I came out with five questions I now ask before I believe any of them. I started because the September launch posts stopped making sense. Claude Opus 5.5 is at 81.8%. GPT-6 Astra is at 72.6%. Both numbers say OSWorld 2.0, and they come from different task files, different subsets and different harnesses. // Detect dark theme
